WEBVTT

00:08:28.712 --> 00:08:30.005
In the bridge,

00:08:30.047 --> 00:08:34.009
I stopped singing for a little bit
and I just hummed a melody.

00:08:34.051 --> 00:08:36.053
(Humming)

00:08:39.807 --> 00:08:41.684
I was thinking about my mom,

00:08:41.684 --> 00:08:45.563
and I wanted to try and represent her
in the music in some way.

00:08:47.314 --> 00:08:49.608
One of the people
who I talked to about the song

00:08:49.608 --> 00:08:51.318
while I was making it was Yo-Yo Ma.

00:08:52.027 --> 00:08:54.446
I told him, this is what the song is about

00:08:54.446 --> 00:08:57.992
and this is what the music
is supposed to do in this part.

00:08:57.992 --> 00:09:01.537
And I asked him,
